comments.body:
@reporter Could you please refer this [doc](https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus/tree/master/deployments/export-log) to export the whole Milvus logs for investigation?
For Milvus installed with docker-compose, you can use docker-compose logs > milvus.log to export the logs.

/assign @reporter

@reporter  Could you please specify your requirements?

 We indeed implemented some more detailed checks after a certain version. Because even if you insert some data, it might not pass the expression filtering.

Are you also only interested in inserting and retrieving?

@reporter Got it, we will support free-form JSON in the new version, and it will also be filterable.
follow the issue: #31051 

Before v2.3.3, we only support JSON data in key-value pair format, but forgot to check the inserted data. This was fixed in v2.3.3.
